+## Repository walk (0.4.2)
+
+`walk_repo(root, &WalkOptions::default(), |entry| WalkControl::Continue)` walks a tree in file-name order and skips whatever `.gitignore` (nested files, negation, `**`, directory-only rules) and `.git/info/exclude` exclude; `.git` is never entered and symlinks are not followed. `GitIgnore` exposes the matcher alone. std only, all platforms, no index needed.
